During the customary weekly full faculty and staff professional development workshops at Kingswood Oxford yesterday, Dennis Bisgaard, Head of School, announced his departure from the school effective June 30, 2018. In a heartfelt, moving speech, Bisgaard stated that he has accepted a job at an international educational startup in its Washington, D.C. site.
